Z||000000||86 FIERO GT||11-26-2001||05:13 PM||||Figured out how to use the PIP so I thought I would post some pics of my stock GT that I got acouple months ago.  Its pretty much worn out on the interior and the body is decent, its been wrecked in the front tho.  It is getting worked over with a fresh suspension and a northstar with the caddy 4speed out of a 93 ETC, if you know anything about N*s, you know what the ETC motors can pack.  Im also puttin some 17 inch five spokes with yokohama rubber.  Hopefully i'll be able to paint it Torch red off the vettes.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mvc-829f.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mvc-890s_1.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mvc-888s_2.jpg"> <P>------------------<BR>86 Fiero GT , soon to be N*ed and worked over.||||reg||10
